@rendermode InteractiveServer
@using System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations
@using Fx.ControlKit
@using FlexCore.Showcase.Components.Shared

@* 2026-10-25: example 3 "property-grid" (SC-347) on a page-local TourPackage. PropertyGridControl lists public get/set properties,
   captioned by splitting the property name, and reads no attributes; a set CustomEditor replaces every row's editor and stops the
   grid's ValueChanged. *@

@* 2026-10-19: new page (SC-028) from the Control tour's Forms tab; docs from Forms/*. Editor-selection and auto-generation lists from
   FormItemControl's if/else chain and FormAutoGeneratedItemsControl's property filter.
